      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 259.05,
      "end_seconds": 272.44,
      "duration_seconds": 13.39,
      "text": "I understand the worry. At the moment I'd say it's a dental abscess, and we'll know more once the a dental X-ray is back. Let's get a dental X-ray, for dental abscess."
    },
