      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 279.91,
      "end_seconds": 297.05,
      "duration_seconds": 17.14,
      "text": "The treatment will be amoxicillin, 500 milligrams, three times a day, five days. It's for dental abscess. See the dentist today, rinse with warm salt water. The dentist would be the right next step, I'll refer you."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0036",
